In physic. 1238.</ITEM> <ITEM><COL N="1880"></COL> In tract. qualitatis. 1391.</ITEM> <ITEM>In variis locis. 354, 652, 1112, 1114, 1213, 1293, 1349,
1750.</ITEM> <ITEM>ATHANASIUS.—Exhort. ad monach. 293.</ITEM> <ITEM>Symbol. Fidei. 150, 339, 366, 367, 654, 986, 1077, 1107,
